GAL trans is a Moldovan carrier company that operates regular bus services from Moldova to Romania, Ukraine and Russia.

With the application from GAL Trans you can easily:
– choose a flight suitable for the requested date;
– check buses routes on the map;
– see buses’ photos;
– make a reservation with payment to the driver during the boarding;
– pay for the ticket online;
– get access to the history of all purchased tickets in the personal account
– make a quick ticket return in your personal account
– request information from support service.

GAL Trans has a large bus fleet that meets European standards.

The professional drivers team will make sure that your trip is as comfortable as possible.

GAL Trans - it's important, who you travel with!

Explore Emerald Faarufushi Resort & Spa and its stunning facilities, plan your visit and activities from your device before and during your visit. Use this app to start planning your stay, and ensure you don’t miss-out on any of the incredible experiences on offer at Faarufushi Maldives. During your stay the app provides the perfect travel companion, showing what’s on, providing you with fantastic inspiration from the recommended Must do list of experiences which you can book directly from the app.  Your itinerary is always accessible to see what adventures you have planned. 
A personal concierge in your pocket!

About the Resort:
Welcome to the Emerald Faarufushi Resort & Spa, a new 5-star Deluxe All-Inclusive Resort, proud member of The Leading Hotels of the World, where tropical landscapes and swaying palm trees are the gateway to refined fusion of nature and indulgence, creating an enchanting atmosphere of barefoot elegance.  The Resort located in the Raa Atoll, in the northern part of the Maldives archipelago, lays on a lush private 7-hectares island with 1.2 km of white sandy beach, and it is surrounded by a gorgeous 100-hectares lagoon with one of the finest coral reefs in the Maldivian ecosystem.

Designed with the discerning traveller in mind, Emerald Faarufushi stands out for its minimalist but modern architecture, authentic cultural experiences and meticulously refined services that defies pretence. 

Use the app to help:
- Complete the check in registration requirements contactless;
- Explore the services and facilities available at the resort;
- Perfect your stay by booking restaurant tables, excursions and activities such as snorkeling, scuba diving or spa treatments;
- view the entertainment schedule for the upcoming week;
- request to book any special events that you’d like to arrange for a loved one;
- book your next stay at the resort.

